{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, approach it, grab it, and process it. Else, move to next location and scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
